<title>USA: Abaxis, Idexx settle lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Abaxis, Idexx settle lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abaxis Inc said on Friday it reached an agreement with Idexx Laboratories Inc to settle a lawsuit relating to certain advertising by Abaxis.</p>
<p>Abaxis said it agreed there will be no further circulation of the advertising in question.</p>
<p>Idexx filed a suit in June against Abaxis in the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of California, charging Abaxis with false and misleading information about a veterinary test made by Idexx.</p>
<p>Abaxis said there was no material adverse financial impact on either party. Other terms of the settlement were kept confidential.</p>
</text>
